```

### Critical-flow sequence

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant S as System
    participant D as Dependency

    U->>S: request
    S->>+D: call (timeout 5s, retry 2× exponential)
    alt success
        D-->>-S: response
        S-->>U: 200
    else timeout / 5xx
        D--xS: error
        S-->>U: 503 with retry hint
        Note over S: alert fires after 3 consecutive failures
    end
```

_Include retries, timeouts, failure paths. No happy-path-only diagrams._

